  "stories": {
   "training_multi_v3_01-01_a": [
    {
     "cmd": "Battle.Pause",
     "args": {}
    },
    {
     "cmd": "InputBlocker",
     "args": {
      "blockInput": true
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "PopupDialog",
     "args": {
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya"
     },
     "text": "博士，许久不见！欢迎再次来到促融共竞的比赛现场！"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "PopupDialog",
     "args": {
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya"
     },
     "text": "与之前一样，促融共竞的所有项目都需要您与<color=#0098DC>一位协作者</color>共同参与，这次就还是让我来当博士的协作者吧！"
    }
   ],
   "training_multi_v3_01-01_b": [
    {
     "cmd": "Battle.Pause",
     "args": {}
    },
    {
     "cmd": "InputBlocker",
     "args": {
      "blockInput": true
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "PopupDialog",
     "args": {
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya"
     },
     "text": "与之前一样，每场比赛分为两个阶段，每个阶段都有需要完成的目标。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Tutorial",
     "args": {
      "target": "panel_cooperate_normal_and_fortress_status",
      "animStyle": "Highlight",
      "focusStyle": "HighlightRect",
      "black": "$f_tut_black",
      "protectTime": 0.5,
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya",
      "dialogX": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_x",
      "dialogY": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_y"
     },
     "text": "本场比赛第一阶段的目标是<color=#0098DC>生存</color>，我们需要在限定时间内抵挡敌方的进攻。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "PopupDialog",
     "args": {
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya"
     },
     "text": "虽然在同一片赛场上竞技，但我们各自需要防守不同的目标点。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Tutorial",
     "args": {
      "focusX": -50,
      "focusY": -70,
      "focusWidth": 130,
      "focusHeight": 130,
      "animStyle": "Highlight",
      "focusStyle": "HighlightCircle",
      "black": 0.5,
      "protectTime": 0.5,
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya",
      "dialogX": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_x",
      "dialogY": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_y"
     },
     "text": "博士，您需要防守的是蓝色的目标点。敌方进入蓝色目标点，将会扣减您的目标生命值。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Tutorial",
     "args": {
      "focusX": 60,
      "focusY": -70,
      "focusWidth": 130,
      "focusHeight": 130,
      "animStyle": "Highlight",
      "focusStyle": "HighlightCircle",
      "black": 0.5,
      "protectTime": 0.5,
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya",
      "dialogX": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_x",
      "dialogY": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_y"
     },
     "text": "墨绿色的目标点由协作者——也就是我来防守。敌方进入墨绿色目标点，则会扣减我的目标生命值。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Battle.Pause",
     "args": {
      "pause": false
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Delay",
     "args": {
      "time": 1
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Battle.Pause",
     "args": {
      "pause": true
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Tutorial",
     "args": {
      "focusX": 55,
      "focusY": 85,
      "focusWidth": 100,
      "focusHeight": 100,
      "animStyle": "Highlight",
      "focusStyle": "HighlightCircle",
      "black": 0.5,
      "protectTime": 0.5,
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya",
      "dialogX": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_x",
      "dialogY": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_y"
     },
     "text": "对了！协作者部署的干员会用特殊的颜色标记出来，这样您就不会混淆双方的干员了。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Tutorial",
     "args": {
      "focusX": -50,
      "focusY": 170,
      "focusWidth": 120,
      "focusHeight": 120,
      "animStyle": "Highlight",
      "focusStyle": "HighlightCircle",
      "black": 0.5,
      "protectTime": 0.5,
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya",
      "dialogX": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_x",
      "dialogY": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_y"
     },
     "text": "与上一届赛事不同的是，本届赛事会存在<color=#0098DC>共同敌手</color>。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Tutorial",
     "args": {
      "focusX": -15,
      "focusY": 200,
      "focusWidth": 120,
      "focusHeight": 120,
      "animStyle": "Highlight",
      "focusStyle": "HighlightCircle",
      "black": 0.5,
      "protectTime": 0.5,
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya",
      "dialogX": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_x",
      "dialogY": "$f_lower_dialog_pos_y"
     },
     "text": "当带有这个标记的<color=#0098DC>共同敌手</color>进入任意一方的目标点时，我们双方都会扣减关卡生命。"
    }
   ],
   "training_multi_v3_01-01_c": [
    {
     "cmd": "Battle.Pause",
     "args": {}
    },
    {
     "cmd": "PopupDialog",
     "args": {
      "dialogHead": "$avatar_amiya"
     },
     "text": "即使我们之中有一方的目标生命值归零，我们的队伍也不会立刻输掉比赛。"
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Battle.Pause",
     "args": {
      "pause": false
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Delay",
     "args": {
      "time": 2
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Battle.Pause",
     "args": {
      "pause": true
     }
    },
    {
     "cmd": "Tutorial",
     "args": {
      "focusX": 40,
      "focusY": -30,
      "focusWidth": 150,
      "focusHeight": 150,
      "animStyle": "Highlight",
      "focusStyle": "HighlightCircle",
